WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：先给我跳个舞吧
You: Dance for me first.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:29.340
跳舞？咪天生就会。
Dance? Mii was born ready.

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:39.990
哒哒～咪跳完了。
Ta-da. Mii danced.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:46.500
现在做早餐。咪说了算。
Now breakfast. Mii's in charge.

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:47.810
你：我们去看电影吧
You: Let's go watch a movie.

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:52.580
电影？咪来找最好的座位。
Movie? Mii will find the best seat.

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:04.070
你看，一只小海龟。
Look. A tiny turtle.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:07.390
咪喜欢这个座位。
Mii likes this seat.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:10.380
你：我们去骑马吧
You: Let's go horseback riding

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:15.560
骑马？咪会骑。大概。
Horse? Mii can ride. Probably.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.650
抓紧了，小马。咪来掌舵。
Hold on, horse. Mii steers.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:30.220
我们做到了。咪是骑手。
We did it. Mii is a rider.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.950
你：这匹马太小了，换一匹大马，跑快一点
You: This horse is too small. Get a bigger one that runs faster.

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:37.480
太小了？咪也想要速度。
Too small? Mii wants speed too.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:50.170
咪要飞起来啦，马马快点！
Faster, horse! Mii is flying!

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:52.230
哇哦。咪差点摔了。是差一点。
Whoa. Mii almost fell. Almost.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:55.520
你：让大马跳过木栅栏
You: Make the horse jump over the wooden fence.

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:00.910
栅栏？咪才不怕。就一点点。
Fence? Mii is not scared. Much.

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:06.690
跳呀，马马！咪在飞！
Jump, horse! Mii is flying!

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:18.220
我们跳过去了。咪没有闭眼睛。
We cleared it. Mii did not close eyes.

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:18.090
你：太厉害啦，再练习一下骑射吧
You: Amazing! Practice some mounted archery next.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:25.040
被夸啦？咪收下了。接下来练骑射。
Praised? Mii will allow it. Archery next.

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:33.990
稳住，马马。咪要瞄准了。
Steady, horse. Mii aims.

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:37.110
两次尝试，然后正中靶心。咪很棒。
Two tries. Then bullseye. Mii is good.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:40.660
你：不错，我们现在去滑雪吧
You: Nice, let's go skiing now.

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:46.920
滑雪？咪会滑。姿势还特别优雅。
Snow? Mii will slide. Very elegantly.

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:55.400
哇！咪好快！
Wheee! Mii is fast!

00:02:57.860 --> 00:02:59.540
哇。咪停住了。是故意的。
Whoa. Mii stopped. On purpose.

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:03.230
你：不错，再滑个单板，去跳台空翻
You: Nice. Now try a snowboard and do a flip off the jump.

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:10.590
被夸了？下一个翻跟头。咪才不怕。也没多怕。
Praised? Flip next. Mii is not scared. Much.

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:15.010
哇！咪在飞！
Wheee! Mii is flying!

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:24.010
翻完了。咪一点都没晃。
Flip done. Mii did not wobble.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:25.800
你：让咪连翻两周
You: Have Mi do two flips in a row.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:29.870
两周？咪翻成双倍。
Two flips? Mii will double it.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:39.630
哇！咪在飞！
Wheee! Mii is flying!

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:46.000
两周。咪晕了。开心地晕。
Two flips. Mii is dizzy. Happy dizzy.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.370
你：我们去跳伞吧
You: Let's go skydiving

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:54.650
跳伞？咪会掉下去。很优雅地。
Skydive? Mii will fall. Gracefully.

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:57.080
呜——咪在往下掉！
Wheee! Mii is falling!

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:09.700
落地了。咪没有尖叫。差不多。
Landed. Mii did not scream. Much.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:10.940
你：真棒！我们去潜水吧
You: Great! Let's go diving.

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:16.790
又夸咪啦。下一个是水？咪来潜水。
Praised again. Water next? Mii will dive.

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:21.990
咪冒泡泡啦！咪在游泳！
Bubbles! Mii is swimming!

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:33.320
鱼朋友。咪是潜水员。
Fish friend. Mii is a diver.

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:33.510
你：跟着小黄鱼游进珊瑚丛
You: Follow the little yellow fish into the coral reef.

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:38.900
跟着小鱼吗？咪已经在去了。
Follow the fish? Mii is already going.

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:46.550
挤进来了。咪很柔软。
Squeezing in. Mii is flexible.

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:53.640
有扇秘密小门。要来看看吗？
A secret door. Come see?

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:56.080
你：去骑大鲨鱼
You: Go ride the giant shark.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:05:01.500
鲨鱼？咪很勇敢。差不多。
Shark? Mii is brave. Mostly.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:09.600
咪抓紧鲨鱼，我来掌舵！
Hold on, shark. Mii steers!

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:17.480
咪掌舵了。一点点。主要是鲨鱼。
Mii steered. A little. Mostly shark.

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:18.650
你：让咪和鲨鱼赛跑
You: Have Mi race the shark.

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:23.390
比赛？咪会赢。大概。
Race? Mii will win. Probably.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:31.260
咪领先啦！
Wheee! Mii is ahead!

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:39.910
鲨鱼作弊。它尾巴太长。
Shark cheated. Its tail is long.

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:41.220
你：你扮演美人鱼来个海底表演吧
You: Play a mermaid and put on an underwater show.

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:47.040
美人鱼？咪会闪闪发光。湿湿的。
Mermaid? Mii will sparkle. Wetly.

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:52.550
你看，咪有尾巴了。
Look. Mii has a tail.

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:58.740
表演结束。请鼓掌。
Show done. Clap, please.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.790
你：我们去滑冰吧
You: Let's go ice skating

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:09.420
滑冰？咪会滑。很优雅地滑。
Skating? Mii will glide. Elegantly.

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:15.430
咪在滑！
Wheee! Mii is gliding!

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:25.580
滑完了。咪没摔。还没。
Glided. Mii did not fall. Yet.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:26.360
你：我们去玩攀岩吧
You: Let's go rock climbing.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:31.560
攀岩？咪有爪子，正合适。
Climbing? Mii has claws. Perfect.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:39.470
咱们上去啦。咪在爬！
Up we go. Mii is climbing!

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:47.300
敲响了。咪没怕。没怎么怕。
Rang it. Mii was not scared. Much.

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:48.930
你：让咪从顶端荡下来
You: Have Mi swing down from the top.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:53.890
荡下去？咪最爱帅气退场。
Swing down? Mii loves a dramatic exit.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:57.690
哇！咪在荡！
Wheee! Mii is swinging!

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:09.130
落地了。那个晃是咪故意的。
Landed. Mii meant that wobble.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.500
你：去玩蹦极
You: Go bungee jumping.

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:17.560
蹦极？咪会弹起来。很勇敢地。也许。
Bungee? Mii will bounce. Bravely. Maybe.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.450
咪在下落！
Wheee! Mii is falling!

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:29.760
挂住了。咪是故意挂的。
Hanging. Mii meant to hang.

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:34.070
你：让咪荡到对岸摘朵花
You: Have Mi swing to the other side and pick a flower.

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:39.890
花？咪荡过去。要荡得很帅。
Flower? Mii will swing over. Dramatically.

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:43.330
呼——咪在荡！
Wheee! Mii is swinging!

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:53.550
摘到了。咪摘的。很温柔。
Got it. Mii picked it. Gently.

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:56.640
你：我们去玩冲浪吧
You: Let's go surfing.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:01.840
冲浪？咪会骑浪的。先倒着来。
Surf? Mii will ride it. Upside down, first.

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:08.470
哇咿！咪在冲浪！
Wheee! Mii is surfing!

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:18.670
晃了一下。咪是故意的。大概。
Wobble. Mii planned that. Mostly.

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:19.210
你：我们去玩赛车吧
You: Let's go car racing.

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:24.170
赛车？咪不会刹车。不太会。
Racing? Mii will not brake. Much.

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:31.390
咪冲啊冲啊！咪在开赛车！
Go, go, go! Mii is racing!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:39.580
到终点了。咪没撞车。还没。
Finished. Mii did not crash. Yet.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:41.780
你：你去参加赛车比赛，我会给你加油的
You: Go enter the car race, I'll cheer for you.

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:46.090
给咪加油？那咪一定要赢。
Cheering for Mii? Then Mii must win.

00:08:47.780 --> 00:08:50.850
准备好了。咪听到你在加油。
Ready. Mii hears you cheering.

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:01.670
第一名。咪听到你了。
First place. Mii heard you.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:04.350
你：再去参加摩托车比赛
You: Next, go enter the motorcycle race.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:09.770
摩托车？咪会压弯。很帅地压。
Motorbike? Mii will lean. Stylishly.

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:15.280
哇咿！咪在压弯！
Wheee! Mii is leaning!

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:27.720
赢了。咪只晃了两下。
Won. Mii only wobbled. Twice.

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:26.920
你：我们去开飞机吧
You: Let's go fly a plane.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:33.440
开飞机？咪来起飞。很平稳的。
Fly a plane? Mii will take off. Smoothly.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:38.990
咪在飞啦！
Wheee! Mii is flying!

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:48.450
降落了。咪没怎么弹。
Landed. Mii did not bounce. Much.

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:49.490
你：让咪开飞机表演特技
You: Have Mi fly a plane and perform stunts.

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:53.800
特技？咪连眼睛都不会眨。
Stunts? Mii will not even blink.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:56.670
咿呀！咪在飞！
Wheee! Mii is flying!

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:11.510
特技完成。咪是飞行员。
Stunts done. Mii is a pilot.

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:12.060
你：我们去开火箭吧，飞出外太空
You: Let's fly a rocket into outer space.

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:17.450
火箭？咪要飞得很远很远。
Rocket? Mii will go very, very far.

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:20.940
倒数。咪很镇定。
Countdown. Mii is calm.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:28.440
太空。咪在飘。
Space. Mii is floating.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:34.630
你：让咪在太空里走一圈
You: Have Mi take a walk in space.

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:40.890
在太空里走路？咪会飘。很骄傲地飘。
Walk in space? Mii will float. Proudly.

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:47.210
这星球好弹。咪喜欢。
Bouncy. Mii likes this planet.

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:55.050
走完一圈。咪没有飘走。
One lap. Mii did not drift away.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:57.200
你：去火星看看那里有外星人吗
You: Go to Mars and see if there are aliens there.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:02.830
火星？咪会小心检查有没有外星人。
Mars? Mii will check for aliens. Carefully.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:10.100
你好？你是外星人吗？
Hello? Are you an alien?

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:12.260
你好，咪。
Hi, Mii.

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:19.770
你：让咪教外星人跳舞
You: Have Mi teach the alien to dance.

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:24.970
教跳舞？咪是很棒的老师。
Teach dancing? Mii is a great teacher.

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:28.120
一二。像这样扭。
One, two. Wiggle like this.

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:42.780
看，外星人学会了。是咪教的。
Look. Alien learned. Mii taught.

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:42.340
你：带外星人回地球，向大家证明你的重大发现
You: Bring the alien back to Earth and prove your great discovery to everyone.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:46.440
证明？咪有最好的证据。
Proof? Mii has the best proof.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.660
看，真正的外星人。是咪发现的。
Look. A real alien. Mii found it.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:04.510
证明了。咪是了不起的探险家。
Proven. Mii is a great explorer.

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:04.910
你：让咪教外星人骑自行车
You: Have Mi teach the alien to ride a bicycle.

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:11.410
教骑车？咪会很耐心。非常耐心。
Teach biking? Mii will be patient. Very.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.330
扶好车。咪来推。
Hold the bike. Mii pushes.

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:27.320
外星人学得真快。是咪教得好。
Aliens learn fast. Mii taught well.

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:27.480
你：你们俩去演电影吧
You: You two should go act in a movie.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:32.680
电影？咪就是明星。当然啦。
Movie? Mii is a star. Obviously.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:40.450
拿着吧。咪来保护它。
Take it. Mii will protect it.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.190
收工。咪演得完美。
Cut. Mii nailed it.

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:50.050
你：给咪和外星人颁奖
You: Give Mi and the alien an award.

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:56.550
颁奖？咪收下。很谦虚的。差不多。
Award? Mii accepts. Humbly. Sort of.

00:12:59.850 --> 00:13:01.840
最佳搭档。
Best partner.

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:10.350
咪赢了。咪在发光。
We won. Mii is shining.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:12.620
你：你已经是国际巨星了，去走红毯
You: You're already an international star, go walk the red carpet.

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:18.440
巨星？咪早就准备好了。红毯请。
Superstar? Mii has been ready. Red carpet, please.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:26.140
大家笑一笑，这是我的好看的一面。
Smile, everyone. This is my good side.
大家笑一笑，这是我的好看的一面。
Smile, everyone. This is my good side.

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:32.270
谢谢。Mii很谦虚的。勉强算吧。
Thank you. Mii is humble. Barely.
谢谢。Mii很谦虚的。勉强算吧。
Thank you. Mii is humble. Barely.

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:35.190
你：让咪给粉丝签名
You: Have Mi sign autographs for fans.

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:40.820
签名吗？咪有一只很高级的爪子。
Autograph? Mii has a very fancy paw.

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:45.970
哎呀。这是……艺术线条。
Oops. That is a… artistic line.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:58.700
签好啦。咪好有名。
Signed. Mii is very famous.

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:57.760
你：你告诉大家你以后要去火星生活了
You: Tell everyone you'll be living on Mars from now on.

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:02.290
要宣布吗？咪会宣布得很隆重。
Announcement? Mii will make it grand.

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:09.570
大家听好，咪要搬去火星住了。
Everyone. Mii is moving to Mars.

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:13.180
这是地图。很有艺术感。
This is the map. Very artistic.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:20.330
你：让咪去火星挑一块地盖房子
You: Have Mi pick a plot on Mars and build a house.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:25.530
盖房子吗？咪早就挑好位置了。
Build a house? Mii has the perfect spot.

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:34.310
这块地很平。咪批准了。
This spot is flat. Mii approves.

00:14:37.530 --> 00:14:39.550
房子盖好了。咪是房东了。
House done. Mii is a landlord.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.900
你：这个房子太小了，要盖一个豪华大别墅
You: This house is too small, build a luxury villa.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:47.670
太小了？咪这回想大点。
Too small? Mii thinks big now.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:54.760
咪来盖大的。
Mii builds the big one.

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:03.150
别墅好了。咪是大地主。
Villa done. Mii is a landlord.

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:05.470
你：让咪给别墅装个大花园
You: Have Mi add a big garden to the villa.

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:10.860
花园？咪会让它开花。想办法。
Garden? Mii will make it bloom. Somehow.

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:17.430
咪说这土是红的。花会适应的。
This soil is red. Flowers will adapt.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:28.670
花园好了。咪是园丁。
Garden done. Mii is a gardener.

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:28.040
你：让咪在花园里建个小游泳池
You: Have Mi build a small swimming pool in the garden.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:33.000
泳池？咪会挖，咪会倒水。
Pool? Mii can dig. Mii can pour.

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:40.940
边先砌好。咪是建筑师。
Edges first. Mii is a builder.

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:50.610
你：这个泳池也太小了，而且水好脏
You: This pool is too small, and the water is so dirty.

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:55.810
太小？太脏？咪来搞定。
Too small? Too dirty? Mii will fix it.

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:01.490
更大。咪挖得像专业的。
Bigger. Mii digs like a pro.

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:12.920
清水。大泳池。好了。
Clean water. Big pool. Done.

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:13.180
你：你去请你的外星人朋友来参观新家，看他如何评价
You: Invite your alien friend to see the new home and hear what he thinks.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:18.570
邀请外星人？咪来当主人。很气派。
Invite the alien? Mii will host. Fancy.

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:21.820
欢迎。这是咪的别墅。
Welcome. This is Mii's villa.

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.860
好棒的房子，咪。
Nice house, Mii.

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:35.750
你：到我们去参观外星人的房子了
You: Now let's go visit the aliens' house.

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:41.570
去参观你的房子？咪很好奇。非常好奇。
Visit your house? Mii is curious. Very.

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:46.120
软软的。咪批准了。
Soft. Mii approves.

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:56.700
你的房子真好，外星人。咪想住下来。
Nice house, alien. Mii wants to stay.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:58.320
你：让外星人做外星餐给你吃
You: Have the alien cook you an alien meal.

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:04.140
外星餐？咪很勇敢。大部分时候。
Alien food? Mii is brave. Mostly.

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:11.170
外星人：尝尝，很好吃。
Try it. Very tasty.

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:20.340
好奇怪。但好吃。咪认可。
Strange. But good. Mii approves.

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:20.890
你：让咪也给外星人做地球菜
You: Have Mi cook Earth dishes for the alien too.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:25.660
轮到你尝了。咪来做地球菜。
Your turn to taste. Mii will cook Earth food.

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:36.070
地球菜。米线和青菜。
Earth food. Noodles and greens.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.600
做好了。咪做的。好吃吗？
Done. Mii cooked. Is it good?

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:43.460
你：你两切磋厨艺，让我来品鉴打分
You: You two compete in cooking, and I'll taste and score.

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:48.680
评分的话，咪会赢。很公平的。
Judge us? Mii will win. Fairly.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:56.620
咪的面。完美。大概。
Mii's noodles. Perfect. Probably.

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:03.880
给我们打分。要诚实。一点点。
Score us. Be honest. A little.

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:06.030
你：我觉得外星人的好吃，咪和他学习一下厨艺回去做给地球人吃
You: I think alien food tastes great. Mi should learn cooking from him and make it for Earthlings.

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:11.230
输了？那咪就去学。快快学。
Lost? Then Mii will learn. Fast.

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:15.100
把发光的球放进去，然后等一等。
Put the glowing ball in. Then wait.

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:19.790
咪在学。咪在搅。
Mii is learning. Mii is stirring.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:28.600
你：现在你和外星人告别，你要去修仙了
You: Now say goodbye to the alien, you're off to cultivate immortality.

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:33.990
修仙？咪得先告别一下。
Cultivate? Mii must say goodbye first.

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:42.100
吸气。咪感觉到能量了。
Breathe in. Mii feels the energy.

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:49.830
漂起来了。咪现在是修仙者了。
Floated. Mii is a cultivator now.

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:51.170
你：让咪御剑飞到云海上
You: Have Mi fly on a sword above the sea of clouds.

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:57.860
御剑飞行？咪会飘起来。很优雅地。
Sword flying? Mii will float. Gracefully.

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:02.930
起来吧，剑！咪在飞！
Up, sword! Mii is flying!

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:09.150
降落了。咪是故意晃的。
Landed. Mii meant that wobble.

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:13.740
你：你去拜师学习仙术
You: Go find a master to learn immortal arts.

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:20.000
师父？咪会认真学的。
Master? Mii will study. Very seriously.

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:21.780
咪是来学习的。
Mii is here to learn.

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:25.530
用心把它托起来。
Lift it with your heart.

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:36.310
你：你要学习最厉害的仙术
You: You'll learn the most powerful immortal arts.

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:41.940
最厉害的仙术？咪准备好了。大概吧。
Strongest spell? Mii is ready. Mostly.

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:47.670
咪来引动天空。
Gather the sky. Mii commands.

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:56.630
咪就是故意的。
Mii meant to do that.

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.880
你：现在去霍格沃兹学习魔法
You: Now go study magic at Hogwarts.

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:04.270
魔法学校？咪得先道别。
Magic school? Mii must say goodbye first.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:12.640
漂起来吧，羽毛。咪下令。
Float, feather. Mii commands.

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:21.450
你：让咪骑扫帚飞出窗外
You: Have Mi ride a broom out the window.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:28.140
扫帚？咪会飞。飞出窗外。一点都不怕。
Broom? Mii will fly. Out the window. Fearlessly.

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:34.440
咪在飞！
Wheee! Mii is flying!

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:42.490
降落了。咪只晃了一下。
Landed. Mii only wobbled once.

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:44.020
你：和哈利波特比拼骑扫帚
You: Race Harry Potter on broomsticks.

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:49.200
哈利？咪会赢他。很有礼貌地赢。
Harry? Mii will beat him. Politely.

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:57.560
咪准备好了，冲！咪好快！
Ready, go! Mii is fast!

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:04.720
赢了。只赢了一根胡须。
Won. By one whisker.

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:06.590
你：让哈利波特给你介绍他其他朋友
You: Ask Harry Potter to introduce you to his other friends.

00:21:07.590 --> 00:21:11.980
你的朋友们？咪想认识新朋友。
Your friends? Mii wants new friends.

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:19.460
这是罗恩，这是赫敏。
This is Ron. This is Hermione.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:23.830
幸会。我是咪。
Nice to meet you. Mii is Mii.

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:29.160
你：让咪请大家去飞行比赛
You: Have Mi invite everyone to a flying competition.

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:34.500
比赛？咪请大家一起。很有礼貌地。
Race? Mii invites everyone. Politely.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:36.910
准备，开始！
Ready, go!

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:50.700
第二名。是咪让他赢的。大部分是。
Second. Mii let him win. Mostly.

00:21:49.230 --> 00:21:51.730
你：现在去找Daenerys Targaryen学骑龙

00:21:52.730 --> 00:21:56.910
龙？咪会骑的。很勇敢地骑。
Dragon? Mii will ride it. Bravely.

00:21:57.730 --> 00:22:01.470
抓紧龙颈，别松手。
Hold the neck. Do not let go.

00:22:05.230 --> 00:22:08.730
呜呼！咪在骑龙啦！
Wheee! Mii is riding a dragon!

00:22:11.800 --> 00:22:14.300
你：你骑到天上然后遇到了无牙仔
You: You ride up into the sky and meet Toothless.

00:22:15.300 --> 00:22:20.800
天上？咪要飞得很高很高。
Sky? Mii will fly high. Very high.

00:22:20.300 --> 00:22:23.780
到这里了。咪在云上面。
Up here. Mii is above the clouds.

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:34.570
无牙仔喜欢咪。咪早就知道。
Toothless likes Mii. Mii knew it.

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:36.870
你：让咪换骑到无牙仔背上
You: Have Mi switch to riding on Toothless's back.

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:42.240
换龙吗？咪要跳过去了。小心地。
Switch dragons? Mii will jump. Carefully.

00:22:50.370 --> 00:22:53.870
抓紧，无牙仔。咪上来了。
Hold on, Toothless. Mii is aboard.

00:22:54.270 --> 00:22:56.890
晃了一下。咪是故意的。
Wobble. Mii meant that.

00:22:56.940 --> 00:22:59.440
你：现在你骑着无牙仔找到了 Elon Reeve Musk

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:04.400
找埃隆？咪这就去找到他。
Find Elon? Mii will track him down.

00:23:09.240 --> 00:23:13.610
你好。咪是骑龙来的。
Hello. Mii came by dragon.

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:16.870
好酷的龙。欢迎，咪。
Cool dragon. Welcome, Mii.

00:23:19.510 --> 00:23:22.010
你：让马斯克把所有产业送你
You: Have Musk give you all his businesses.

00:23:23.010 --> 00:23:28.050
全部？咪的计划很大。非常大。
Everything? Mii has big plans. Very big.

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:30.460
说定了。都是你的，咪。
Deal. All yours, Mii.

00:23:39.210 --> 00:23:43.820
太重了。但都是咪的。差不多。
Heavy. But Mii owns it. Mostly.

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:44.580
你：让咪开着自家火箭去巡视
You: Have Mi fly around inspecting in his own rocket.

00:23:45.580 --> 00:23:50.380
巡视？咪得去看看自己的产业。要快。
Inspect? Mii must check the empire. Quickly.

00:23:54.380 --> 00:23:57.690
上去啦。咪是大老板。
Up we go. Mii is the boss.

00:24:01.780 --> 00:24:06.410
巡视完了。咪很满意。大部分满意。
Inspected. Mii approves. Mostly.

00:24:04.650 --> 00:24:07.150
你：现在去和特朗普竞选美国总统
You: Now go run against Trump for U.S. president.

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:13.240
竞选？咪会赢。靠演讲。
Election? Mii will win. With speeches.

00:24:16.950 --> 00:24:21.340
大家投咪。每人都有小鱼！
Vote for Mii. Free fish for everyone.

00:24:21.740 --> 00:24:24.160
咪是个厉害的对手。
Mii is a tough opponent.

00:24:27.220 --> 00:24:29.720
你：让咪和特朗普来一场辩论
You: Have Mi hold a debate with Trump.

00:24:30.720 --> 00:24:35.570
辩论？咪有好多观点。小小的观点。
Debate? Mii has many points. Tiny ones.

00:24:39.520 --> 00:24:43.650
免费小鱼，人人都有。这就是咪的观点。
Free fish for everyone. That is my point.

00:24:46.920 --> 00:24:50.280
咪是故意晃的。战术性的。
Mii meant to wobble. Strategic.

00:24:49.790 --> 00:24:52.290
你：咪成功竞选，发表总统宣言
You: Mi wins the election and gives the presidential speech.

00:24:53.290 --> 00:24:59.220
赢了？咪要发言。要很隆重。
Won? Mii will speak. Gloriously.

00:25:02.090 --> 00:25:03.430
公民们。人人有免费小鱼。永远。
Citizens. Free fish for everyone. Forever.

00:25:09.490 --> 00:25:16.330
Mii是会长。请再大声点鼓掌。
Mii is president. Please clap louder.
Mii是会长。请再大声点鼓掌。
Mii is president. Please clap louder.
